# Patch: 05_flash_attention.diff
# Lever: L8 flash-attention core for alphafold Attention (global_config.use_flash_attention, set only by predict_pdb.py -flash_attn): the logits/softmax/weighted-sum core of every eligible Attention call is computed by the kit's adapter af2ig_opt.flash_attn (the tree's shared Pallas kernel); ineligible calls run the stock ops and are counted
# Numerics class: TIER-2: changes numerics (online-softmax re-association; not bitwise vs the stock ops)
# Default: off; enabled only by predict_pdb.py -flash_attn
# Applies to: nrbennet/dl_binder_design @ cafa3853ac94dceb1b908c8d9e6954d71749871a with 00-03 applied (predict_pdb.py exists after 00; config.py carries 02 + 03); apply with: patch -p1 < 05_flash_attention.diff  (from the repository root)
